  "details": "1. Create an Excellent avatar (Robot).\n\n2. Add 3 particle systems, each with 2147483647 max particles and 2147483647 max lights using one shared point light prefab.\n\n3. Add 3 point lights.\n\n4. Check the SDK builder for alerts to review.\n\nExpected result: Show a Very Poor performance alert in the SDK builder about 2147483647 lights.\n\nActual result: No alert, the lights counter has overflowed into negative integers (-2147483647 lights), \"Excellent\".\n\nAdditional info: No effect on the avatar's stats itself if the avatar is published to VRChat. Having only 2 point lights reports 2147483647 lights in the SDK (screenshot 2), as intended.",
